{"results":[{"url":"https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in","title":"Raghav Utopia Goregaon West, Mumbai | 2 & 3 BHK flats","raw_content":"* [Floor Plan](#configration_floor_plan)\n* [Price](#configration_floor_plan)\n* [Gallery](#gallery)\n\n![Raghav Utopia  Banner](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/1763444001.jpg)\n\nMahaRERA Website\n\n [maharera.maharashtra.gov.in](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/) \n\nProject MahaRERA No.\n\n [![PR1180002501406](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/qr/PR1180002501406_-18112025072045.jpg)](javascript:void(0);)\n\nProject MahaRERA No.\n\n [![A51700026634](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/qr/A51700026634.png)](javascript:void(0);)\n\nProject MahaRERA No. PR1180002501406\n\n[![PR1180002501406](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/qr/PR1180002501406_-18112025072045.jpg)](javascript:void(0);)\n\nProject MahaRERA No. A51700026634\n\n[![A51700026634](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/qr/A51700026634.png)](javascript:void(0);)\n\n![Raghav Utopia  Banner](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/1763444001.jpg)\n\nFor Best Offers Fill Your Details\n\n![Raghav Group Developer](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/1678871226.svg)\n\nRaghav Group\n\nDeveloper\n\n![Goregaon West, Mumbai Location](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/1678871255.svg)\n\nGoregaon West, Mumbai\n\nLocation\n\n# About Raghav Utopia Project\n\n**Raghav Utopia Goregaon West Mumbai** is a residential project by **Raghav Group** situated in the premium location of Goregaon West, Mumbai, Shastri Nagar, offering **2 & 3 BHK** flats with availability of Jodi Apartments. Also get Floor Plan, Price Sheets, RERA ID, Reviews, Possession Timeline, Construction Status, Location Advantages, Address, Amenities, and Specifications. Utopia by Raghav Group has an **Exclusive Tower** of **G + 20 Storeys**. Raghav Goregaon West has 2 BHK & 3 BHK configuration with **carpet area**  2 BHK is 732 sq.ft  **Price** starts ₹ 2.15 Cr\\* and 3 BHK with a carpet area of 908 sq.ft - ₹ 2.75 Cr\\*Onwards. Utopia Mumbai Raghav **RERA No**.PR1180002501406, Raghav Mumbai Utopia  property focuses on proper design & layout in accordance with the rules of Vastu.\n\nRaghav Goregaon West has **Excellent Connectivity** Western Express Highway - ( 5 mins), Metro Station - (10 mins), International Airport - (20 mins), St. John’s Universal, Vibgyor High School, Patkar College, Mithibai College, Kokilaben Hospital, SRV Hospital, Lifeline Medicare, Jama Masjid (10 mins), Inorbit Mall, Oberoi Mall, Infinity Mall.\n\nUtopia Mumbai Raghav **Address -** Shastri Nagar, Road No. 1, Goregaon West, Mumbai.\n\nRaghav Goregaon West has Amenities like Fully equipped gymnasium, fitness center, Jogging track, yoga, meditation zones, Multipurpose hall, Jogging track, yoga, meditation zone, and Swimming pool with sun deck and 24×7 Surveillance.\n\nRaghav Mumbai Goregaon West has **Internal Features** like sliding windows with mosquito net and invisible safety grill, Sliding door or foldable door for terraces, Glass railing for terrace & balcony. Kitchen - Dado tiles above the platform up to 2 feet, Granite body tile kitchen platform with Stainless steel sink, Flooring - Vitrified tile flooring, and Anti-skid tile flooring in toilets. Concealed plumbing and Jaguar fittings.\n\nRaghav Utopia has **Ongoing, Upcoming, and Completed Projects .**\n\nThe Ongoing and Upcoming Projects are Raghav Nova - Kurla East, Raghav Marvel - Kurla East, Raghav Parijat - Kurla East, Raghav Enclave - Kurla East, Raghav Vista - Chembur, Raghav Paradise - Borivalli\n\nThe Completed Projects are Raghav One - Kurla East, Raghav One 45 - Kurla East, and Raghav Amara - Kurla East.\n\n![_ Elevation Image](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/image1763443802.jpg)\n\n## Raghav Utopia Overview\n\n![Project Name](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/image1729333292.svg)\n\nProject Name\n\nRaghav Utopia\n\n![Location](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/image1729333246.svg)\n\nLocation\n\nGoregaon West, Mumbai\n\n![Developer Name](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/image1729333232.svg)\n\nDeveloper Name\n\nRaghav Group\n\n![TOTAL TOWERS](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/image1678871433.svg)\n\nTOTAL TOWERS\n\n1\n\n![FLOORS](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/image1678871419.svg)\n\nFLOORS\n\nG + 4P + 17 Storey\n\n![APARTMENTS](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/image1678871403.svg)\n\nAPARTMENTS\n\n2 & 3 BHK\n\n![AREA](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/image1678871390.svg)\n\nAREA\n\n732 - 908 Sqft\n\n![POSSESSION](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/image1678871368.svg)\n\nPOSSESSION\n\nUnder Construction\n\n![RESEDENTIAL](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/image1678871349.svg)\n\nRESEDENTIAL\n\nProperty\n\n## Raghav Utopia Property Specification\n\n|  |\n| --- |\n| Lifestyle amenities like Swimming Pool and Gym |\n| 2 & 3 BHK Balcony homes with ample of Sunlight and with good Ventilation |\n| Utopia near Western Express Highway by 5 mins |\n| Assured Rental Income till Possession and No Floor Rise |\n| G + 4P + 17 floors Iconic tower with Balcony View Homes and Podium Carpark |\n\n## Configuration & Price Of Raghav Utopia\n\n| Type | Carpet Area (sq ft) | Price |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n|\n| 2 BHK | 732 Sqft | ₹ 2.15 Cr\\* |\n|\n| 3 BHK | 908 sq.ft | ₹ 2.75 Cr\\* |\n\n## Raghav Utopia Floor Plan\n\n## Raghav Utopia Gallery\n\n### Elevation Images\n\n![Raghav-Utopia-Elevation-Image](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/Raghav-Utopia-Elevation-Image-18112025054454.jpg)\n\nRaghav-Utopia-Elevation-Image\n\n### Sample Flat Photos\n\n![Raghav-Utopia-Lobby-Area](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/Raghav-Utopia-Lobby-Area-18112025054534.jpg)\n\nRaghav-Utopia-Lobby-Area\n\n![Raghav-Utopia-Master-Bedroom](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/Raghav-Utopia-Master-Bedroom-18112025054556.jpg)\n\nRaghav-Utopia-Master-Bedroom\n\n![Raghav-Utopia-Living-Area](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/Raghav-Utopia-Living-Area-18112025054623.jpg)\n\nRaghav-Utopia-Living-Area\n\n![Raghav-Utopia-Kitchen-Area](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/Raghav-Utopia-Kitchen-Area-18112025054645.jpg)\n\nRaghav-Utopia-Kitchen-Area\n\n#### External Amenities\n\n* Fully equipped gymnasium\n* Fitness center\n* Jogging track\n* Yoga\n* Meditation zones\n* Multipurpose hall\n* Jogging track\n* Swimming pool with sun deck and 24×7 Surveillance\n\n#### Internal Features\n\n* 2 or 3 track sliding windows with mosquito net and invisible safety grill\n* Sliding door or foldable door for terraces\n* Glass railing for terrace & balcony. Kitchen - Dado tiles above the platform up to 2 feet\n* Granite body tile kitchen platform with Stainless steel sink\n* Flooring - Vitrified tile flooring\n* and Anti-skid tile flooring in toilets. Concealed plumbing and Jaguar fittings.\n\n## Raghav Utopia Walkthrough Video\n\n![https://www.youtube.com/embed/sTXxEveA_Yw](//i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/sTXxEveA_Yw/maxresdefault.webp)\n\n![https://www.youtube.com/embed/sTXxEveA_Yw](//i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/sTXxEveA_Yw/maxresdefault.webp)\n\n![image](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/Raghav-Utopia-Developer-Name_-18112025055042.jpg)\n\n## Raghav Group\n\nRaghav Real Estate Group, also known as Raghav Group or Raghav Realty, is an emerging and growing real estate developer primarily active in Mumbai.  Raghav Group focuses mainly on residential developments and has delivered numerous 1, 2, and 3 BHK projects, especially in locations like Kurla and Borivali. Raghav Group has completed and ongoing projects such as Raghav Enclave, Raghav Nova, Raghav Marvel, Raghav Parijat, and Raghav Paradise. Trust, transparency, safety, and timely delivery, the group's positions a customer-focused developer offering quality homes. Raghav Real Estate Group aims to provide affordable and premium lifestyle spaces.\n\n### Enquire Now\n\n### Raghav Utopia Construction Status\n\n## Raghav Utopia Location\n\n## Raghav Utopia Sales Gallery / Office Address & Experience Center\n\nShastri Nagar, Road No. 1, Goregaon West, Mumbai\n\n## Raghav Utopia MahaRera\n\n[![PR1180002501406](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/qr/PR1180002501406_-18112025072045.jpg)](javascript:void(0);) \n\nPR1180002501406\n\nThe website project is registered under  [maharera.maharashtra.gov.in](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/)\n\n## Frequently Asked Question\n\n[Who is Raghav Real Estate Group?](#collapse0)\n\nRaghav Real Estate Group is a growing real estate developer known for delivering quality residential projects across Mumbai and Maharashtra. They focus on trust, transparency, and timely construction.\n\n[What types of projects does Raghav Group develop?](#collapse1)\n\nRaghav Group primarily develops residential properties, including 1 BHK, 2 BHK, and 3 BHK apartments in well-connected areas of Mumbai.\n\n[What amenities does Raghav Real Estate Group provide?](#collapse2)\n\nDepending on the project, amenities may include landscaped gardens, modern security systems, fitness centers, children’s play areas, and parking facilities.\n\n[What is the RERA No of Raghav Utopia Project?](#collapse3)\n\nThe RERA No of Raghav Utopia Project is PR1180002501406\n\n[What is the Address of Raghav Utopia Project ?](#collapse4)\n\nThe address of Raghav Utopia Group is Shastri Nagar, Road No. 1, Goregaon West, Mumbai\n\n[![Raghav Utopia ](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/qr/A51700026634.png)](https://maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in/agent/view/40583) \n\n[![Raghav Utopia ](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/qr/A51700026634.png)](https://maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in/agent/view/40583)  