 Property Specialist\n\n100+ transactions closed · Worli, Lower Parel, Bandra, BKC\n\n[WhatsApp directly](https://wa.me/918433511885?text=Hi%2C%20I'm%20interested%20in%20Raghav%20Utopia%20(PB17797795061150)%20%E2%80%94%20can%20you%20share%20details%3F)[About →](/about)\n\n### Get details on this property\n\nLeave your number — we reply within 30 min on WhatsApp.\n\n[Chat on WhatsApp](https://wa.me/918433511885?text=I'm%20interested%20in%20Raghav%20Utopia%20(2%20BHK%2C%20Goregaon%20West)%20at%202.15%20Cr.%20Can%20you%20share%20more%20details%3F)\n\n## Similar Properties\n\n[![2 BHK Arkade Evoke, Bangur Nagar, Goregaon West — 2.61 Cr](/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcuupvswzdyykhxfwoyjh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2FPROPERTY-PHOTOS%2FPB17798803899250%2F1779880417835.jpeg&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_2GyGRHCSCg6TNqZSyBr1oncKXKPM)For Sale\n\n### Arkade Evoke\n\n2 BHK Residential\n\nBangur Nagar, Goregaon West\n\n2.61 Cr₹34,987/sqft\n\nArea746 sqft\n\nFloorLow Floor (1-7)\n\nPossessionDec 2028\n\nEnquire Now](/property/arkade-evoke-PB17798803899250)[![2 BHK Palkhi Viraya, MG Road, Goregaon West, Mumbai — 1.6cr](/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcuupvswzdyykhxfwoyjh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2FPROPERTY-PHOTOS%2FPB17864372514934v4g%2F1786437251494-73evw6.jpeg&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_2GyGRHCSCg6TNqZSyBr1oncKXKPM)For Sale\n\n### Palkhi Viraya\n\n2 BHK Residential\n\nMG Road, Goregaon West, Mumbai\n\n1.6cr₹23,460/sqft\n\nArea682 sqft\n\nFloorMid Floor (8-15)\n\nPossessionAug 2028\n\nEnquire Now](/property/palkhi-viraya-PB17864372514934v4g)[![2 BHK Palkhi Viraya, MG Road, Goregaon West, Mumbai — 1.7cr++](/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcuupvswzdyykhxfwoyjh.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2FPROPERTY-PHOTOS%2FPB1786437333400q2cv%2F1786437333400-vde1h5.jpeg&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_2GyGRHCSCg6TNqZSyBr1oncKXKPM)For Sale\n\n### Palkhi Viraya\n\n2 BHK Residential\n\nMG Road, Goregaon West, Mumbai\n\n1.7cr++₹24,390/sqft\n\nArea697 sqft\n\nFloorMid Floor (8-15)\n\nPossessionAug 2028\n\nEnquire Now](/property/palkhi-viraya-PB1786437333400q2cv)\n\nHave questions about this property?\n\n[WhatsApp Us](https://wa.me/918433511885?text=I'm%20interested%20in%20Raghav%20Utopia%20(2%20BHK%2C%20Goregaon%20West)%20at%202.15%20Cr.%20Can%20you%20share%20more%20details%3F)\n\n[WhatsApp](https://wa.me/918433511885?text=I'm%20interested%20in%20Raghav%20Utopia%20(2%20BHK%2C%20Goregaon%20West)%20at%202.15%20Cr.%20Can%20you%20share%20more%20details%3F)[Enquire Now](#enquiry)","images":[]},{"url":"https://housiey.com/projects/raghav-utopia","title":"Raghav Utopia Goregaon west- Brochure, Pros&Cons, PriceSheet","raw_content":"Raghav Utopia Goregaon west- Brochure, Pros&Cons, PriceSheet\n\n[Home](/)\n[Mumbai](/in/mumbai)\n\n>\n\n[Goregaon West](/in/mumbai/goregaon-west)\n\nLast updated: Jul 15, 2026\n\n![Project image 1](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/raghav-utopia_1775715173962-291882427-1280w.webp)![Project image 2](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/raghav-utopia_1775715174817-351607770-1280w.webp)![Project image 3](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/raghav-utopia_1775715175503-184987456-1280w.webp)![Project image 4](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/raghav-utopia_1775715176225-781765907-1280w.webp)\n\n# Raghav Utopia Goregaon west\n\n[By Raghav Group](/builder/raghav-group)|\n\nShastri Nagar, [Goregaon West](/in/mumbai/goregaon-west)\n\n₹2.20 Cr - 2.78 Cr All inc.\n\n![Raghav Utopia Goregaon west - main project image](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/raghav-utopia_1775715173962-291882427-1280w.webp)\n\n![Raghav Utopia Goregaon west - image 2](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/raghav-utopia_1775715174817-351607770-1280w.webp)\n\n![Raghav Utopia Goregaon west - image 3](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/raghav-utopia_1775715175503-184987456-1280w.webp)\n\n![Raghav Utopia Goregaon west - image 4](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/raghav-utopia_1775715176225-781765907-1280w.webp)\n\nWatch This Project Reel\n\nSee highlights of Raghav Utopia\n\n[View Full Reel](/reels)\n\nExplore More Reelsin Goregaon West\n\nWatch reels of other projects in the same locality\n\n[Watch All Reels](/reels)\n\nWatch This Project Reel\n\nSee highlights of Raghav Utopia\n\n[View Full Reel](/reels)\n\nExplore More Reelsin Goregaon West\n\nWatch reels of other projects in the same locality\n\n[Watch All Reels](/reels)\n\n## Raghav Utopia Overview\n\n![Land Parcel](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fland-parcel-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n0.19 acres\n\nLand Parcel\n\n![Towers](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fnumber-of-towers-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n1\n\nTowers\n\n![Floors](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fnumber-of-floors-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nG+4P+17\n\nFloors\n\n![Config](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fconfig-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n2, 3 BHK\n\nConfig\n\n![Carpet Area](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fcarpet-area-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n721-908 sqft\n\nCarpet Area\n\n![RERA NO.](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2FRERA-number-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nPR1180002501406\n\nRERA NO.\n\n![Possession Status](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fpossession-status-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nEarly Stage (2-3 yrs)\n\nPossession Status\n\n![Target Possession](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Ftarget-possession-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nDec 2028\n\nTarget Possession\n\n![RERA Possession](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2FRERA-possession-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nDec 2029\n\nRERA Possession\n\n![Litigation](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Flitigation-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nNo\n\nLitigation\n\n### About Raghav Utopia\n\nRaghav Goregaon West Project Overview  \nRaghav Utopia Project will be constructed on 0.19 acre of land parcel, 1 tower with G+4P+17 floors having 2 BHK, 3 BHK premium residences.  \n  \nRaghav Utopia location  \nProject is Located Near New Link Rd, Shashtri Nagar, Goregaon West, Mumbai with -  \nBangur Nagar Metro Stn - 550m  \nSV Rd - 900m  \nWEH - 2.9km  \n  \nRaghav Utopia Goregaon West Project Amenities  \nFirst is Internal amenities -  \nVitrified Tiles, Intercom, Kitchen Platform, CCTV & many more  \n  \nRaghav Realty Goregaon West External Amenities  \nProject has amenities with likes of -  \nInfinity Swimming Pool  \nGymnasium  \nKids play Area  \nYoga Deck  \nSenior Citizen Area many more  \n  \nRaghav Realty Utopia Goregaon West Parking -  \nProject has one type of car parking facility -  \n1) Podium  \n  \nRaghav Utopia Possession -  \nRera Possession - December 2029  \nTarget Possession - December 2028  \n  \nCarpet Area & Floor Plan  \nRaghav Utopia project has 2BHK, 3BHK premium residences with -  \n2BHK - (721 to 732) sqft  \n3BHK - (884 to 908) sqft  \n  \nRaghav Utopia floor plan  \nTower floor plan will have 5 flats, 3 lifts & 1 staircase on each floor  \n  \nUtopia Prices & its details can be found in the price section & Raghav Utopia Goregaon West brochure can be downloaded from the link mentioned below. Project has been praised by the home buyers & Raghav Realty Goregaon West review is 4 out of 5 from over all the clients who have visited the site.\n\n## Raghav Utopia Location\n\nNear New Link Rd, Shastri Nagar, Goregaon West, Mumbai\n\n* Bangur Nagar Metro Stn - 550m\n* S.V. Rd - 900m\n* WEH - 2.9km\n\n![360 background](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2F360-background-image.webp&w=1280&q=75)\n\n![Housiey Logo](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Flogo1.png&w=256&q=75)\n\n![360](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2F360-tour-icon.png&w=128&q=75)\n\n## Raghav Utopia Videos\n\n## Raghav Utopia Pros & Cons\n\n![Pros-icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fthumbs-up-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nPros\n\n![toggle-arrow](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Farrow-down-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n1.The project is located at a prime location near New Link Road, offering excellent connectivity to Bangur Nagar Metro Station, Oberoi Mall, and the Western Express Highway.\n\n![Cons-icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fthumbs-down-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nCons\n\n![toggle-arrow](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Farrow-down-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n1.The project offers relatively small carpet areas, especially in the 2 & 3 BHK layouts. So, if you are looking for spacious apartments, this project may not be the right fit for you.\n\n## Raghav Utopia Amenities\n\n### Internal Amenities\n\n![Vitrified Tiles](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652438961711-img.webp)\n\nVitrified Tiles\n\n![Granite Kitchen Platform](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/granite-kitchen-platform_External_1770712604025-330259421.webp)\n\nGranite Kitchen Platform\n\n![CCTV Camera](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/cctv-camera_External_1770712182845-897978997.webp)\n\nCCTV Camera\n\n### External Amenities\n\n![Swimming Pool](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652447054692-img.webp)\n\nSwimming Pool\n\n![Kids Play Area](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652446278292-img.webp)\n\nKids Play Area\n\n![Jogging Track](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/jogging-track_External_1770724897454-7779386.webp)\n\nJogging Track\n\n![Senior Citizen Area](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652446899508-img.webp)\n\nSenior Citizen Area\n\n![Yoga Zone](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652447479516-img.webp)\n\nYoga Zone\n\n![Seating Area](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/seating-area_External_1770882751990-34368358.webp)\n\nSeating Area\n\n![Gymnasium](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/gymnasium_External_1770730220696-33756910.webp)\n\nGymnasium\n\n![Multi purpose hall](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/multi-purpose-hall_External_1770717854977-274652141.webp)\n\nMulti purpose hall\n\n## Raghav Utopia Master & Floor Plan\n\n### Master Plan\n\n![Raghav Utopia Master Plan](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/raghav-utopia_1775715179454-582431966-1280w.webp)\n\n### Floor Plan\n\n![Raghav Utopia Floor Plan](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/raghav-utopia_1765452631453-396389258-1280w.webp)\n\n## Raghav Utopia Pricing & Unit Plans\n\n| Carpet Area | All Inc. Price  (Inc. of Taxes & Charges) | Min Downpayment  (Inc. Taxes) | Parking | Unit Plan |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 721 sqftLimited | 2.20 Cr All In | 33.00 Lacs | 1 |\n| 732 sqft | 2.20 Cr All In | 33.00 Lacs | 1 |\n\nCarpet:721 sqft\n\n![Unit plan - 721 sq.ft.](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/unit_plans/image_0_1765452855796-324594880.webp)\n\n2.20 CrAll Inc. Price(Inc. of Taxes & Charges)\n\n33.00 Lacs\n\nMin Downpayment(Inclusive Taxes)\n\n1Parking\n\nLimited\n\nDown Payment\n\nLoan Amount\n\nInterest\n\nDuration\n\n₹0EMI\n\nCarpet:732 sqft\n\n## Raghav Utopia Payment Scheme\n\nRegular Standard Slabwise Payment as per construction, Maximum loan possible up to 90%\n\n## Raghav Utopia Litigation Details\n\nIs there any litigation against this proposed project:\n\nNo\n\n## Documents For Raghav Utopia\n\n![category icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Flegal-paper-icon.png&w=64&q=75)\n\n### Commencement Certificate\n\n![pdf icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fpdf-icon.png&w=64&q=75)\n\nRaghav Utopia Commencement Certificate\n\n![category icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Flegal-paper-icon.png&w=64&q=75)\n\n### Legal Title Report\n\n![pdf icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fpdf-icon.png&w=64&q=75)\n\nRaghav Utopia Legal Title Report\n\n![category icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Flegal-paper-icon.png&w=64&q=75)\n\n### Layout Plan\n\n![pdf icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fpdf-icon.png&w=64&q=75)\n\nRaghav Utopia Building / Layout Plan\n\nNote: You can download more detailed documents by following this [link](https://maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in/public/project/view/56221)\n\n## Raghav Utopia QR Codes\n\n[![RERA QR code - PR1180002501406](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/RERA-QR-images/rera_qr_code_1775716684579-733881110.webp)\n\nPR1180002501406](https://maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in/public/project/view/56221)\n\n## Project approved by\n\n## About Raghav Group\n\nRaghav Group\n\n![Raghav Group](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/builders/Logog--1692944648342-img.webp)\n\n3 CitiesLocations\n\nMumbai CityMumbai suburbanPune\n\n10 yearsExperience\n\n9Total Projects\n\n500+Happy Families\n\nEstablished by a first generation Real Estate entrepreneur, RAGHAV Group aims to build quality and thoughtful homes for everyone. The Founder, Mr. Sudhanshu Agarwal, has been associated with various Real Estate Groups and MNCs, having a decade long experience in managing diversified businesses. He has been instrumental in executing various projects across the skyline of Mumbai.\n\n## Frequently Asked Question\n\nThe sample flat is not ready yet. However, Housiey provides detailed floor plans, 3D walkthroughs, and virtual consultations with a property expert. Our team can explain the layout, unit sizes, and project details in detail.\n\nThe expected possession date is **01 December 2029** as per RERA. Construction is currently **25%** complete as of July 15, 2026. Target possession is **01 December 2028**.\n\nYes, it is RERA registered. The RERA number is **PR1180002501406**.  \nYou can verify it on the official RERA portal: <https://maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in/public/project/view/56221>\n\nNo, it has no pending litigation. All legal documents including the Commencement Certificate and Legal Title Report are available on Housiey for review before booking.\n\nThe following legal documents are available on Housiey: **Commencement Certificate**, **Legal Title Report**, **Layout Plan**, **Proforma Allotment Letter**, **Proforma Sale Agreement**. You can preview them directly on the project page or verify them independently on the official RERA portal using RERA number **PR1180002501406**.\n\nThis project offers **11+** amenities. Key external amenities include Multi purpose hall, Gymnasium, Seating Area, Yoga Zone, and Senior Citizen Area.  \n Internal specifications include CCTV Camera and Granite Kitchen Platform. The complete amenities list is available on Housiey.\n\nMonthly maintenance details are available in the price sheet. You can download it from the project page on Housiey.\n\nIn Raghav Utopia, the 2BHK units are available in the following carpet area options:  \n• **721 sq. ft.**  \n• **732 sq. ft.**  \nEach configuration may differ slightly in layout, balcony size, or orientation. Our team can walk you through floor plans for each option during your consultation or site visit.\n\nIn Raghav Utopia, the 3BHK units are available in the following carpet area options:  \n• **884 sq. ft.**  \n• **908 sq. ft.**  \nEach configuration may differ slightly in layout, balcony size, or orientation. Our team can walk you through floor plans for each option during your consultation or site visit.\n\nThe all-inclusive price of a 2BHK in Raghav Utopia starts from **₹2.20 Cr** and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.   \n• **721 sq. ft.** – ₹2.20 Cr (all-inclusive)  \n• **732 sq. ft.** – ₹2.20 Cr (all-inclusive)  \nThe price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.\n\nThe all-inclusive price of a 3BHK in Raghav Utopia starts from **₹2.75 Cr** and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.   \n• **884 sq. ft.** – ₹2.75 Cr (all-inclusive)  \n• **908 sq. ft.** – ₹2.78 Cr (all-inclusive)  \nThe price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.\n\nIt is built across **0.19 acres** with **1** towers with **G+4P+17** floors. Each floor has **5** flats per floor, **3** lifts, **1** staircases. It is available in **2BHK/3BHK** configurations with carpet areas ranging from **721** to **908 sq. ft.**\n\nRaghav Utopia provides dedicated car parking facilities for residents. The exact parking type and the number of spaces allotted per unit are mentioned in the Unit Plan, which you can download for free on the Raghav Utopia project page on Housiey.\n\nIt is located at **Near New Link Rd, Shastri Nagar, Goregaon West, Mumbai**.  \nNearby landmarks include:  \n**• Bangur Nagar Metro Stn - 550m**   \n**• S.V. Rd - 900m**   \n**• WEH - 2.9km**\n\nThe following payment plans are available:  \n• **CLP ( Construction Link plan)** - Regular Standard Slabwise Payment as per construction, Maximum loan possible up to 90%  \n  \n**Note:** In some cases, payment plan deviations can be considered based on your preferred terms. The final schedule is confirmed after your site visit.\n\nThe minimum down payment starts from **₹33.00 Lacs**, inclusive of all taxes. EMI options are also available. Use the EMI calculator on the project page to check monthly instalments based on your loan amount and tenure.\n\nYes, it is approved by leading banks including **Central Bank of India**, **Union Bank of India**, **Bank Of India**, **Bank Of Baroda**, **Citi Bank**, **Kotak Mahindra Bank**, **Axis Bank**, **State Bank Of India**, **ICICI Bank**, **HDFC BANK**. The complete approved bank list is available in the Banks section on Housiey. Home loan eligibility depends on the bank's lending policy and your profile.\n\nNo - Housiey follows a strict no-brokerage policy. You pay only the builder's official price - no commission, no hidden charges, and no middlemen. This applies to all projects listed on Housiey.\n\nIt is developed by **Raghav Group**, a trusted real estate brand with over **10 years** of experience and more than **9 completed projects** across **Mumbai City, Mumbai suburban and Pune**.  \n**Some of their notable developments include:**  \n  \n • **Raghav Reserve** in Chikhali, Pune  \n  \n • **Raghav Ananta** in Vikhroli East, Mumbai  \n  \n • **Raghav Avenue** in Chembur East, Mumbai  \n  \n • **Raghav Vista** in Kurla East, Mumbai  \n  \n • **Raghav Enclave** in Kurla East, Mumbai\n\nThe Commencement Certificate is available. The **Occupancy Certificate (OC)** will be applied for closer to the possession date, as per standard regulatory timelines. All currently available documents are listed in the Documents section on Housiey.\n\nYes - book a free site visit through Housiey. We arrange a free Ola cab pickup and drop from your location.  \n  \nAlternatively, you can schedule an online project presentation directly by the builder from home. Both options are 100% free with no obligation to buy.\n\nYes - NRIs can purchase this project under FEMA regulations. Payment can be made via NRE or NRO accounts. Home loans are available from Indian banks with a co-applicant. Housiey's team assists NRI buyers with documentation and Power of Attorney requirements remotely - 100% free.\n\n**Goregaon West** is one of Mumbai's sought-after micro-markets with consistent property appreciation.  \n  \nThis project by **Raghav Group** - with 10 years of experience - offers 2BHK/3BHK at ₹2.20 Cr to ₹2.78 Cr, making it a strong long-term investment opportunity.\n\nBuying through Housiey gives you:  \n(1) No brokerage - you pay the builder's exact price  \n(2) Free Ola cab site visit  \n(3) Online project presentation by the builder from home  \n(4) Free legal consultation via Housiey Legal  \n(5) Honest Pros & Cons review on every project  \nAll services are 100% free with